{"id":"n71498-1-16","stage":2,"title":"안주 · 下酒菜","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71498-1-16-1","ko":"여기 맥주 두 병 주세요.","zh":"请给我两瓶啤酒。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"맥주","meaning":"啤酒","explanation":"맥주：啤酒","readings":[{"term":"맥주","audio":"/audio/87234064f9ef0d6fd8db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30216","senseId":"1","lemma":"맥주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맥주","audio":"/audio/87234064f9ef0d6fd8db.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"병","meaning":"瓶","explanation":"병：瓶","readings":[{"term":"병","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62777","senseId":"2","lemma":"병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"87234064f9ef0d6f","term":"맥주","zh":"啤酒","audio":"/audio/87234064f9ef0d6fd8db.mp3","entryId":"30216","definition":"主要